### 2. ALUR ADMIN (BUTUH TOKEN)

### A. Login Admin (Dapatkan Token JWT)
POST {{host}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### B. Cek Riwayat Pesanan (Harus pakai Token)
GET {{host}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json